From fce097e081526abdc41a58cf81148ddcc2e8b5e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: port <a@b>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:51:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 21/24] arm64: dts: qcom: sda660-xiaomi-clover: CPU DVFS test
 DTBs, one per speed bin

sdm660-cprh-osm.dtsi carries the CPU-DVFS hunks of HiBy patch 0041
verbatim (SAW L2 AVS ports, cpufreq-hw, CPRh, fuse cells, corners); the
idle, GPU, display and watchdog parts are left out and no shared SoC file
is touched. The CPU OPP rows are generated from clover's own Android OSM
tables for speed bins 0, 1, 3 and 4; the driver's FREQ/OVERRIDE/SPARE
words for all 55 rows equal clover's Android words exactly.
